From: AOSC OS Package Maintainers <maintainers@aosc.io>
Subject: [PATCH] FIXUP: Match the DRM mode table declaration to its definition

The definition in drm.cpp and shared declaration in drm.h both have 14
elements. Match them here to fix the type mismatch diagnosed by LTO, without
changing the table or mode mapping.

--- a/drmrx/mkmscmap.cpp
+++ b/drmrx/mkmscmap.cpp
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@
 extern int freq_ref_cells_k_list[4][3];
 extern int x_list[4];
 extern int k0_list[4];
-extern int mode_and_occupancy_code_table[24];
+extern int mode_and_occupancy_code_table[14];
 extern int time_ref_cells_cnt_list[4];
 extern int lFAC;
 extern int MSC_Demapper[6][2959];
